Package: miter
Title: Iterative modelling and forecasting tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Regis A.", "Ely", , "regisaely@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2468-3761"))
Maintainer: Regis A. Ely <regisaely@gmail.com>
Description: Provides tools for iterative modeling and forecasting with tidymodels.
    Facilitates creating nested tables for grouped time series data, adding multiple
    modeling workflows, performing cross-validation, fitting models, generating
    predictions, and creating ensemble models. Designed for easy iteration over
    multiple time series groups with consistent modeling pipelines.
